User: The hotel is clean, comfortable and a good location. Very close to Salt Lake and Mackenzie Beach. Very close to bus stop. Very close to the airport, the bus only costs 1.5 euros to and from the airport. From the hotel you can just walk along the entire promenade of Larnaca, you won’t miss anything. A calm step along the sea to the Church of St. Lazarus 30-40 minutes. The room was wonderful. White bed. Breakfast can be bought directly at the hotel for only 8 euros. I rented a car, there is a place to park. The shower is wonderful, the air conditioner works, we were in January, it was very warm and sunny. Everything is great. The owner of the hotel was very friendly, allowed to leave things, even after we checked out, I highly recommend,

